  "introduction": [
    "Drawing from the arcane power of the dragon spirit, the auraphage is filled to the brim with the untamed arcane prowess that dragons hold over mortal beings. This power can be explosive and dangerous, but through sheer force of will, the auraphage offers their body and mind as kindling to stoke and tame the flames of the arcane furnace within them."
